{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>For Heshbon was the city of Sihon king of the Amorites.</b> The reason we said that all the cities of the Amorites are daughter-cities of Heshbon is that Heshbon was the royal capital of Sihon king of the Amorites before he conquered the cities of Moab."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:32.415454979Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}